.TH FYNEDESK-COMPOSITOR 1 "February 2026" "FyneDesk" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fynedesk-compositor \- FyneDesk Wayland compositor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fynedesk-compositor
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fynedesk-compositor
is a Wayland compositor built with wlroots 0.17 and the Fyne GUI toolkit.
It provides a full desktop environment with a panel, app launcher, virtual
desktops, window management, and more.
.PP
The compositor is normally started by a display manager (GDM, SDDM, greetd)
via the
.I fynedesk-wayland.desktop
session file. It can also be run nested inside an existing Wayland or X11
session for development.
.SH FEATURES
.IP \(bu 2
Window snapping, maximize, minimize, fullscreen
.IP \(bu 2
4 virtual desktops with slide animations
.IP \(bu 2
Server-side and client-side decorations
.IP \(bu 2
Tiling mode (master+stack layout)
.IP \(bu 2
Window overview (Exposé)
.IP \(bu 2
Frosted glass panel with blur effect
.IP \(bu 2
App launcher with calculator and unit conversion
.IP \(bu 2
Command palette (Super+P)
.IP \(bu 2
Notification system (D-Bus)
.IP \(bu 2
System tray (StatusNotifier)
.IP \(bu 2
Screen locking (ext-session-lock-v1)
.IP \(bu 2
Screenshots via xdg-desktop-portal
.IP \(bu 2
Fractional scaling
.IP \(bu 2
Multi-monitor support with hotplug
.IP \(bu 2
IPC socket for scripting
.IP \(bu 2
Per-app window rules (float, workspace, size)
.IP \(bu 2
Session save/restore (windows relaunched at login)
.IP \(bu 2
Night light (gamma ramp adjustment)
.IP \(bu 2
Clipboard history with persistence
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
The WM modifier (default: Super) is configurable.
.TP
.B Super+T / Super+Enter
Open terminal
.TP
.B Super+Space
App launcher
.TP
.B Super+Tab
Switch windows
.TP
.B Super+W
Window overview
.TP
.B Alt+F4
Close window
.TP
.B F11
Toggle fullscreen
.TP
.B Ctrl+Alt+Left/Right
Switch desktop
.TP
.B Super+L
Lock screen
.TP
.B Alt+Escape
Quit compositor
.PP
See
.BR fynedesk-ctl (1)
for the full list and
.I docs/keybindings.md
for details.
.SH SESSION MANAGEMENT
On clean shutdown (Alt+Escape, logout, or SIGTERM), the compositor saves
the state of all open windows to
.IR ~/.config/fynedesk/session-state.json .
On next startup, saved applications are relaunched and their positions,
desktop assignments, and window states are restored.
.PP
Sessions older than 24 hours are automatically discarded.
.SH WINDOW RULES
Per-application rules can be defined in the configuration file to control
how windows are placed and managed. See
.BR fynedesk (5)
for the
.B [[window_rules]]
format.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/fynedesk/config.toml
Main configuration file. See
.BR fynedesk (5).
.TP
.I ~/.config/fynedesk/session-state.json
Session state for restore at next login.
.TP
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/fynedesk.sock
IPC UNIX socket
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B WLR_BACKENDS
Set to
.I wayland
for nested mode or
.I headless
for testing.
.TP
.B WLR_RENDERER
Set to
.I pixman
for software rendering.
.TP
.B FYNEDESK_TERMINAL
Override the default terminal emulator.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fynedesk-panel (1),
.BR fynedesk-ctl (1),
.BR fynedesk (5)
.SH AUTHORS
FyneDesk contributors.
